  "title": "China's Free AI Just Did My Whole Job in One Sentence",
  "description": "A free Chinese AI called Kimi just ran my whole prospecting workflow from one sentence. Its Agent Swarm spins up dozens of sub-agents that work in parallel: one finds local businesses with no website, another builds each a real site, another pulls the owner's contact and writes the pitch. It reads about 50 files at once, holds 200,000 words of context, and is free to start. Here's how to set it up yourself.\n\nGet the full Kimi setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/18lmt0l-Vq-p8A_hBKIfntyDoi5rBFvOSvFRG8iNeyII/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #AI #Kimi",
